{"unit_id": "tag:006U:statement", "translation": "对于是否有必要说明这样一个集合（set），即一个层（sheaf）在空（empty）集合（set）<MATH_0001>上的全体截面（sections），人们总有些疑惑。\n这是有必要的，而且只要正确理解定义，就会发现我们已经作了说明。具体来说，注意空（empty）集合（set）由空（empty）的开（open）覆盖（covering）所覆盖，因此上面定义中的“截面（sections）族<MATH_0002>”实际上构成一个元素（element），它属于空（empty）积（product），而后者是终对象（final object），所论的范畴（category）就是该层（sheaf）的取值范畴。换言之，只要正确理解定义，就自然可以推出<MATHSEG_0001>一个终对象（final object）<MATHSEG_0002>，而若该层（sheaf）取值于集合（sets），它就是单点集（singleton）。如果不喜欢这个论证，也可以直接要求<MATH_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n特别地，这一条件将保证，若<MATH_0004>是开（open）的且<TEXTITOPEN_0001>不相交（disjoint）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，则\n<MATH_0005>\n（因为纤维积（fibre product）在底为终对象（final object）时就是积（product）。）\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单点集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不相交"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由层在空集上的全体截面组成"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "考察其在空集上的截面"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空", "context": "修饰所考察的集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "与空合用，指截面所对应的开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "构成所考察集合的对象"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空", "context": "修饰被覆盖的集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "与空合用，指被覆盖的对象"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空", "context": "修饰不含成员的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "限定覆盖由开集组成"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "覆盖空集的族"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "定义中所取的一族对象"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "截面族构成的积中成员"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空", "context": "修饰空指标族的积"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积", "context": "以空族为指标的范畴积"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象", "context": "空积在取值范畴中的性质"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "层的取值所在"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "在所论范畴中取值"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象", "context": "定义所推出的空集处取值性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "此处限定其取值于集合"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所考察的层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单点集", "context": "集合范畴中的终对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "断言所取集合为开集"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不相交", "context": "所取开集之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "以终对象为底的范畴构造"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象", "context": "充当纤维积的底"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积", "context": "上述纤维积在该条件下给出的构造"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:006V:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为拓扑空间（topological spaces）。考虑规则<MATH_0003>，它给每个开集（open）<MATH_0004>配以集合（set）\n<MATHSEG_0001>是连续（continuous）的<MATHSEG_0002>，\n并配以显然的限制映射（restriction mappings）。我们断言<MATH_0005>是一个层（sheaf）。为此，设<MATH_0006>是一个开（open）覆盖（covering），且<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>满足<MATH_0009>，对所有<MATH_0010>均如此。\n此时定义<MATH_0011>，令<MATH_0012>等于<MATH_0013>的值，这里的<MATH_0014>可以任取，只要<MATH_0015>成立。根据假设，这一定义是良定义的（well defined）。此外，<MATH_0016>是一个映射（map），它在<MATH_0017>上的限制（restriction）与连续（continuous）映射（map）<MATH_0018>一致。因此，显然<MATH_0019>是连续（continuous）的！\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义的"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "开集及连续性所依附的空间"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "规则所作用的开子集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "规则在给定开集处的取值"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "集合中映射满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "规则所配备的限制映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "对该规则所作的断言"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "限定覆盖由开集组成"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "验证层条件时所取的族"}, {"source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义的", "context": "定义的取值与所选指标无关"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "按局部取值定义的整体对象"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "整体映射在一个开集上的限制"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "描述与限制一致的局部映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "与整体映射的限制一致的局部对象"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "证明所得的整体映射性质"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:006S:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们可以利用上例的结果来定义常值（constant）层（sheaves）。具体来说，设<MATH_0001>是一个集合（set）。赋予<MATH_0002>离散（discrete）拓扑（topology）。设<MATH_0003>为一个开子集（open subset）。于是有\n<MATHSEG_0001>连续（continuous）<MATHSEG_0002>局部常值（locally constant）<MATHSEG_0003>\n因此，给每个开集（open）配以所有取值于<MATH_0004>的局部常值（locally constant）映射（maps）的规则是一个层（sheaf）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "constant", "target_term": "常值"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "constant", "target_term": "常值", "context": "修饰此处所定义的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "利用上例结果定义的一类对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "将赋予离散拓扑的对象"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散", "context": "指定集合所赋拓扑的类型"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "赋予给定集合的结构"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "在其上考察映射的定义域"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "所列等价关系中的映射性质"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值", "context": "所列等价关系中的另一映射性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "规则所作用的开子集"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值", "context": "限定规则所赋予的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "规则在每个开集处所收集的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所得规则满足的性质"}]}
